    "**2. 结点 a：** (G_1 + Y_C + Y_L)U̇_a − Y_L·U̇_b = G_1·U̇_s → 0.2U̇_a + j0.2U̇_b = 2，即 **U̇_a + jU̇_b = 10**。",
    "**3. 结点 b：** −Y_L·U̇_a + (Y_L + G_2)U̇_b = İ_s → j0.2U̇_a + (0.2 − j0.2)U̇_b = 2，即 jU̇_a + (1 − j)U̇_b = 10。",
    "**4. 联立。** 把 U̇_a = 10 − jU̇_b 代入：j10 + U̇_b + (1 − j)U̇_b = 10 → (2 − j)U̇_b = 10 − j10 → **U̇_b = 6 − j2 V** ≈ 6.32∠−18.43° V。",
    "U̇_a = 10 − j(6 − j2) = **8 − j6 V = 10∠−36.87° V**。",
    "**5. 验算（结点 b 的 KCL）。** İ_L = (U̇_a − U̇_b)/(j5) = (2 − j4)/(j5) = −0.8 − j0.4 A，İ_R2 = U̇_b/5 = 1.2 − j0.4 A；İ_L + İ_s = −0.8 − j0.4 + 2 = 1.2 − j0.4 A = İ_R2 ✓。"
  ],
